        </a></dd>

        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>coordinate with specific infection</dd>
        </span>
                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Infection, moderate to severe, caused by bacteria, fungi, or viruses, which occurs either on the external surface of the eye or intraocularly with probable inflammation, visual impairment, or blindness.</dd>
                </span>
            
            <dt>Entry Version</dt><dd>EYE INFECT</dd>
        
                <dt>Entry Term(s)</dt>
                <dd>
                    Ocular Infections
                    
                </dd>
